; While we will always do our very best, we cannot guarantee an EXACT color match for products ordered at different times.<br><br><strong>Items arrived damage:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>If you received items damaged during transit, you must report the damage to us within 72 hours of receiving your order.&nbsp; Seven (7) photos of the damaged products and cartons are required.&nbsp; Inspection of the packages and contents may be needed for damage claims.&nbsp; If these requirements are not made, we will not be able to honor the reshipment, replacement or reimbursement of the items.<br><br><span style="font-weight: bold;">If deemed necessary that the product must be shipped back to Impact Canopies for inspection, it is the customer’s responsibility to pay for shipping.</span></span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-6efc" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-lmUbDS kbVXZM pf-34_ pf-color-scheme-1"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-cTTcKX dkCVVW"><div class="sc-hZDzol kRuHOG pf-35_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-ezrfit gUxRQT pf-36_"><h2 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-bOQUxc cBnkcD pf-37_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-39_">WARRANTY:</span></h2><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-fscnvs ckThdY pf-40_"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-41_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-43_">1 year limited warranty from the date of purchase for stock, unprinted fabric items including tops, walls, rail skirts, table covers, and rain gutters.</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-bWJTsT etBrzF pf-44_ pf-text-1"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kuVMvl bBmUMO pf-46_">6 months limited warranty from the date of purchase for custom printed fabric items - unless otherwise specified - due t